        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>채널코딩(channel coding)</choice_text>
          <commentary>잉여 비트를 추가하는 부호화이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>소스코딩(source coding)</choice_text>
          <commentary>압축하는 부호화이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
